{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 18:46:32.485231", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content=\"Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Overview\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (`switch_0`) and multiple edge switches (`switch_1`, `switch_2`, `switch_3`, `switch_4`). Hosts (`host_1`, `host_2`, `host_3`, `host_4`) are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (`10.0.0.0/24`). The SDN controller operates at `20.0.0.100` and manages the switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### Reachability Analysis\\nPing tests were conducted between hosts to assess connectivity. The results are summarized below:\\n\\n1. **Host-to-Host Connectivity**\\n   - **`host_1` to `host_4`**: Status is `unknown`. No data was transmitted or received, indicating a potential issue.\\n   - **`host_2` to `host_4`**: Successful communication with 0% packet loss. Average RTT is 13.359 ms.\\n   - **`host_2` to `host_1`**: Partial communication with 50% packet loss. Average RTT is 35.758 ms.\\n   - **`host_3` to `host_4`**: Successful communication with 0% packet loss. Average RTT is 14.133 ms.\\n   - **`host_3` to `host_1`**: Partial communication with 50% packet loss. Average RTT is 33.759 ms.\\n   - **`host_4` to `host_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No data was transmitted or received.\\n\\n#### Observations\\n1. **Connectivity Issues**\\n   - `host_1` appears to have significant connectivity problems. It cannot communicate with `host_4` or `host_4` cannot communicate with it. Additionally, communication with `host_2` and `host_3` experiences 50% packet loss.\\n   - `host_4` also shows issues when attempting to communicate with `host_1`.\\n\\n2. **Latency and Packet Loss**\\n   - Communication between `host_2` and `host_4`, as well as `host_3` and `host_4`, is stable with no packet loss and reasonable RTT values.\\n   - Communication involving `host_1` shows elevated RTT values and packet loss, suggesting potential network congestion, misconfiguration, or hardware issues.\\n\\n#### Preliminary Assessment\\n- **Fault Localization**: The primary anomaly seems to be centered around `host_1` and its connectivity to other hosts. Additionally, `host_4` has issues communicating with `host_1`.\\n- **Potential Root Causes**:\\n  - Misconfiguration of `host_1` or its connected edge switch (`switch_1`).\\n  - Issues with the central switch (`switch_0`) or its links to `switch_1` and `switch_4`.\\n  - Problems with the SDN controller's flow rules or OpenFlow communication.\\n\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the exact cause of the anomalies., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.\" additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='ced5c477-b9f3-4eaf-838d-a7adcd302390'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
